    "enUS": {
      "description": "<Gor'mul tosses the amulet into the ground.>\n\nTor'gan sent you, didn't he? Pah! Why he feels some mercy towards me I would not understand. Mercy was denied me when I was not allowed to die with my Warchief in battle. A cruel blow fate has dealt me...",
      "summary": "Speak with Tor'gan.",
      "title": "Raising Spirits",
